# [[predaceous|Predaceous]].
#* '''1806''', {{w|Sir John Barrow, 1st Baronet|John Barrow}}, ''Travels into the Interior of Southern Africa'', London: T. Cadell & W. Davies, Volume I, Chapter 2, p.{{nbsp}}178,<sup>[https://catalog.hathitrust.org/Record/011549826]</sup>
